# JOURNEY · the casino: walk into /casino, read the lobby under Tollomind, sit at the Spins and read
# its paytable, blow a bubble and walk away from it, then leave. Every table is a modal over the
# paused tank and every outcome is random, so the journey expects only what is true either way.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /casino
expect Casino
expect Blackjack
expect Claw
expect ENTER sit down
snap the lobby, Tollomind in his bow tie above the line
key down
key enter
expect Spins
expect ↓ spin
snap the reels at rest
key p
expect Spins#paytable
expect Pearl Dive
snap the paytable names the bonus first
key esc
absent Spins#paytable
key esc
expect ENTER sit down
select Bubble Up
key enter
expect Risk High
key up
expect Risk Stupid
key enter
key esc
expect Leave the table?
snap a bubble in the air stays on the table
key enter
expect ENTER sit down
key esc
absent ENTER sit down
